# Phase 0 needs no secrets and no private keys. Never put a private key here.

# Robinhood Chain RPC. The public endpoint is rate-limited and officially "not for production"
# (docs.robinhood.com/chain/connecting). For anything beyond validation scripts, use a keyed
# provider URL (Alchemy / QuickNode / Chainstack, all listed in the official docs).
ROBINHOOD_RPC_URL=https://rpc.mainnet.chain.robinhood.com
